Rāma dismisses bears monkeys Rākṣasas rejoicing --- Rāma hears sweet sky voice afternoon with brothers --- Puṣpaka declares Kubēra sent him for Rāma --- Kubēra rejoices at Rāvaṇa slaying with host --- Kubēra commands bear Rāma as world conveyance --- Rāma worships Puṣpaka with grain flowers scents --- Rāma frees Puṣpaka to come at memory --- Bharata reports golden age health and wonders --- Citizens pray long reign amid timely rains --- Rāma hears and rejoices happily